agraph","text":"●パープーって言葉の意味わかりますか？♪\nわかりません...\n予想も浮かばんとす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/09/25/1756025/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"威圧感(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"}